  "notes": [
    "No unit-mounted control transformer is drawn on this section; 24V control power arrives from the indoor unit terminal block (R/C), so no primary-across-line transformer net was traced.",
    "Right-hand portion of the sheet (second CONT, second CHS/CH, W2/R/O/Y ladder, second LPS, LLS Note 15, OPT sensor blocks) is cropped/partial and was not fully traced.",
    "OFM appears to have additional speed taps and a ground lead not clearly resolvable; only the two traced leads were captured.",
    "IDTB W2 and the OPT/SIG/GND/+5V sensor connectors at bottom were left off — wiring runs off the cropped edge and could not be reliably followed.",
    "Contactor coil terminal designations (A1/A2) are not printed; coil ends labeled COIL1/COIL2 as drawn.",
    "SPEED UP / motor-speed selector (60/90/120/30) shown but its internal wiring is not legibly traceable."
  ],
  "schema_version": "1"
